  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education/Training Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this planning grant, Organizacin Social Salvador (OSS) will work in approximately four departments of Uruguay in strengthening existing Afro- descendant organizations and formalizing Afro- descendant community groups. OSS expects to formalize and strengthen at least eight existing Afro- descendent groups and offer them the capacity to access government grants targeted to Afro- descendent groups.</narrative>
  </description>
